# oxfmt (via `vp check`/`vp fmt`) reads .gitignore and .prettierignore for its
# ignore list — the `ignorePatterns` key in .oxfmtrc.json is not honored, so the
# exclusions have to live here.
#
# .agents/ and .claude/ hold vendored agent skills installed by the skills CLI.
# They are upstream content pinned by computedHash in skills-lock.json:
# reformatting them desyncs the lockfile and is reverted on the next skill
# update.
.agents/
.claude/
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Generated in full by Vite+ (everything sits between the VITE PLUS markers).
# Formatting it here would be undone the next time the tool rewrites it, which
# would flip CI red on an unrelated change.
AGENTS.md
